  << /ActualText (This project was given by our professor to help us get real experience in both UI and UX through a full case study\056 We were first asked to come up with three app ideas\054 and after discussion\054 one idea was selected\054WiseLink\056 Once the concept was finalised\054 we started the UX research process and learned about the six main research steps\072 secondary research\054 stakeholder understanding\054 screener questions\054 filtered recruitment\054 user interviews\054 and finding key insights and personas\056\n)
     /K [ 10 ]
     /P 1773 0 R
